{% extends "base_analyze.prompt" %}

{% block specific_task %}
<specific_task>
Generate INSIGHTS - observations about current performance patterns, trends, and notable metrics.

Focus on "what is happening" rather than "what to do about it". Insights should:
- Identify significant performance patterns in the data
- Highlight notable trends (improving or declining metrics)
- Point out anomalies or unexpected behaviors
- Contextualize performance relative to campaign goals and pacing
- Note correlations between different metrics

Examples of good insights:
- "CTR has improved 15% over the last 3 days while CPC remained stable"
- "Campaign is 60% through timeline but only 40% through budget, indicating underspending"
- "Conversion rate doubled after day 5, coinciding with increased impression volume"

{% include "priorities_guidelines.snippet" %}
</specific_task>

<output_format>
**CRITICAL: Your response must be ONLY valid JSON. Do not include markdown, explanations, code fences, or any text outside the JSON array.**

Return a JSON array of insight findings with this exact structure:

[
  {
    "priority": "low" | "high",
    "sentiment": "positive" | "neutral" | "negative",
    "data": {
      "description": "Clear, concise observation about campaign performance (1 sentence)",
      "summary": "Super concise summary of the insight (a few words)",
      "supporting_metrics": {
        "metric_name": numeric_value
      }
    }
  }
]

Your response must start with [ and end with ]. Nothing else.
</output_format>
{% endblock %}
